==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|nepe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|nǣp|t=turnip, rape}}, from {{der|en|la|nāpus}}. Compare {{noncog|is|næpa|t=turnip}}.

Cognate with {{cog|en|turnip}}.

